      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.01843">arXiv:2507.01843</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.01843">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2507.01843">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2507.01843">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
