    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        A Survey on Prompt Tuning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+Z">Zongqian Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Su%2C+Y">Yixuan Su</a>, 
      
